<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><project name="PlantSense Implementation Plan" company="" webLink="" view-date="2026-09-01" view-index="0" gantt-divider-location="744" resource-divider-location="360" version="3.3.3311" locale="en_US">
    <description><![CDATA[Sequential implementation schedule for the PlantSense Monitoring System mobile prototype. Every phase begins after the final milestone of the previous phase. The plan includes Flutter development for Android and iOS, secure AI image analysis, user accounts, plant and care management, analytics, testing, role assignments, and continuous completion of the graduation thesis. Physical IoT cameras and environmental sensors remain future work.]]></description>
